Package: rdz
Title: Versioned Serialization for R Objects
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Pedro", "Baltazar", email = "pedrobtz@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
    person("Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates", role = "cph",
           comment = "Zstandard, bundled in src/vendor/zstd")
  )
Description: Writes and reads R objects using a versioned, block-structured
    container format. The format preserves R serialization semantics while
    adding explicit format identification, length validation, and integrity
    checking.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://pedrobtz.github.io/rdz/, https://github.com/pedrobtz/rdz
BugReports: https://github.com/pedrobtz/rdz/issues
Copyright: The authors and copyright holders of the bundled Zstandard
    library are listed in file inst/COPYRIGHTS.
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-US
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    stats,
    utils
Suggests:
    bench,
    data.table,
    fst,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    tibble,
    zufast
